    "description": "Family of instruments designated the CL5200N Series, comprising the CL5200N-B and CL5200N-P models. Class III, mains-powered, self-indicating, price-computing, single or dual-interval, non-automatic weighing instruments designed for direct sales to the public. Plastic construction; operator's keypad; stainless steel load receptor; front and rear LCD displays (CL5200N-B); pole-mounted double-sided LCD display (CL5200N-P); level indicator under the load receptor; integrated printer. Devices include initial/automatic/semi-automatic zero-setting and zero-tracking devices, zero indicator, net indicator, stable weight indicator, semi-automatic subtractive tare weighing device, preset tare, gravity compensation, price-computing, totalisation (including non-weighed items), PLU, fixed weight labelling, multi-vendor operation, calibration/set-up mode via sealed internal switch, and self-service operation."
